{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45059","headline":"奉陪陆使君长源裴端公枢春游东西武丘寺 · 皎然","name":"奉陪陆使君长源裴端公枢春游东西武丘寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云水夹双刹，遥疑涌平陂。\n入门见藏山，元化何由窥。\n曳组探诡怪，停骢访幽奇。\n情高气爲爽，德暖春亦随。\n瑶草自的皪，蕙楼争蔽亏。\n金精落坏陵，劒彩沈古池。\n一览币天界，中峰步未移。\n应嘉生公石，列坐援松枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45059.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45059","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}